  "details": "I'm helping my friend create a new world and we are getting these Errors. This is my friend explained it to me:\n\n\"After installing the current version of unity for vrchat, i cant create any projects with the new version. it loads for ages (like an hour plus) and these errors show up when i eventually manage to get in. i can still use the older version i was using (2022.3.6f1) no problems at all, and i can use the current unity version without vcc for non vrchat stuff\n\nI've tried a few different fixes I've seen online, turning off/allowing programs through the fire wall, installing unity manually or via the creator companion. all end up with the same result.\n\nno relevant error logs in the vcc itself\"\n\nI hope someone can help or this world is dead in the water along with any motivation to create more worlds.",
